1
00:00:04,710 --> 00:00:10,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A long time ago, a powerful demon fox
appeared with nine tails.</font>

2
00:00:11,860 --> 00:00:12,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With its powerful tails,</font>

3
00:00:12,990 --> 00:00:16,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it could smash mountains
and create tidal waves.</font>

4
00:00:16,660 --> 00:00:21,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A band of Shinobi rose to
defend their village from attack.</font>

5
00:00:21,870 --> 00:00:24,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have to wait until
the Fourth Hokage gets here!</font>

6
00:00:24,710 --> 00:00:27,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We can't let it get any closer
to our village!</font>

7
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:37,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One great Shinobi was able to
imprison the monster,</font>

8
00:00:37,850 --> 00:00:39,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but died in the process.</font>

9
00:00:40,320 --> 00:00:46,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This Shinobi was known as...
the Fourth Hokage.</font>

10
00:01:02,450 --> 00:01:03,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

11
00:01:03,710 --> 00:01:05,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why did you do such a thing?!</font>

12
00:01:06,010 --> 00:01:08,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're really gonna get it this time!</font>

13
00:01:13,670 --> 00:01:15,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't care!</font>

14
00:01:15,840 --> 00:01:17,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know your problem?</font>

15
00:01:17,490 --> 00:01:19,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't do the things I do!</font>

16
00:01:20,050 --> 00:01:21,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Only I can do this!</font>

17
00:01:22,060 --> 00:01:24,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm better than all of you!</font>

18
00:01:24,680 --> 00:01:25,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's a problem, sir!</font>

19
00:01:25,890 --> 00:01:26,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokage-sama!</font>

20
00:01:27,480 --> 00:01:28,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

21
00:01:28,730 --> 00:01:32,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did that Naruto do something again?</font>

22
00:01:32,940 --> 00:01:35,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes. He climbed onto
the Mountainside Images...</font>

23
00:01:35,650 --> 00:01:37,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And he vandalized and
graffitied all over them!</font>

24
00:01:48,090 --> 00:01:48,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!</font>

25
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:54,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ha ha...</font>

26
00:01:54,460 --> 00:01:56,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why should I?</font>

27
00:01:56,920 --> 00:01:58,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Naruto!</font>

28
00:02:02,800 --> 00:02:06,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How did you suddenly get here,
Iruka-sensei?</font>

29
00:02:06,180 --> 00:02:09,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The question is what are you doing here
when you should be in class now?</font>

30
00:02:11,940 --> 00:02:13,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now listen, Naruto.</font>

31
00:02:13,650 --> 00:02:17,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You failed the last graduation test
and the one before that.</font>

32
00:02:17,980 --> 00:02:20,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is no time
to be goofing off, you fool!</font>

33
00:02:22,910 --> 00:02:25,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We will have a re-test on
the Transformation Jutsu!</font>

34
00:02:26,130 --> 00:02:28,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even those who already passed
will take it!</font>

35
00:02:28,660 --> 00:02:29,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

36
00:02:30,330 --> 00:02:32,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Haruno Sakura. Here I go...</font>

37
00:02:32,600 --> 00:02:33,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Transform!</font>

38
00:02:38,130 --> 00:02:38,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

39
00:02:40,300 --> 00:02:41,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I did it!</font>

40
00:02:42,390 --> 00:02:43,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shannaro!</font>

41
00:02:44,510 --> 00:02:46,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you see that, Sasuke-kun?</font>

42
00:02:46,220 --> 00:02:47,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next, Uchiha Sasuke.</font>

43
00:02:48,140 --> 00:02:48,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

44
00:02:54,270 --> 00:02:55,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">O-Okay.</font>

45
00:02:58,780 --> 00:03:00,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next, Uzumaki Naruto.</font>

46
00:03:01,530 --> 00:03:03,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a real pain.</font>

47
00:03:04,130 --> 00:03:05,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And it's all your fault.</font>

48
00:03:05,870 --> 00:03:07,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like I care!!</font>

49
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:11,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay...</font>

50
00:03:12,750 --> 00:03:15,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good luck, Naruto-kun...</font>

51
00:03:16,170 --> 00:03:17,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Transform!</font>

52
00:03:28,390 --> 00:03:29,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How was it?</font>

53
00:03:29,220 --> 00:03:30,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I call it the "Sexy Jutsu"!</font>

54
00:03:30,640 --> 00:03:34,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You fool!
Stop making idiotic spells!</font>

55
00:03:40,320 --> 00:03:41,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn...</font>

56
00:03:41,930 --> 00:03:42,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn...</font>

57
00:03:43,450 --> 00:03:46,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you go home
unless you clean that all up.</font>

58
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:49,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't care...</font>

59
00:03:49,750 --> 00:03:52,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's nobody home anyway.</font>

60
00:03:57,840 --> 00:03:58,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

61
00:04:00,300 --> 00:04:01,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it this time?</font>

62
00:04:02,340 --> 00:04:04,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What I meant was...</font>

63
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:09,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you clean up all that mess,
I'll buy you ramen tonight.</font>

64
00:04:12,030 --> 00:04:12,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

65
00:04:13,850 --> 00:04:17,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes!
I-I will finish it no time!</font>

66
00:04:18,440 --> 00:04:23,410
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Enter!</font>

67
00:04:18,440 --> 00:04:23,410
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Uzumaki Naruto</font>

68
00:04:32,330 --> 00:04:33,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto.</font>

69
00:04:34,750 --> 00:04:37,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why did you vandalize those faces?</font>

70
00:04:37,840 --> 00:04:40,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you know who
the Hokage leaders are?</font>

71
00:04:41,210 --> 00:04:42,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course, I do!</font>

72
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:52,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know they earned the
title of Hokage</font>

73
00:04:52,670 --> 00:04:55,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">because they were the best Ninja
of their time, right?</font>

74
00:04:58,190 --> 00:05:00,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Especially the Fourth Hokage
was a hero</font>

75
00:05:00,270 --> 00:05:03,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who saved the village from
the nine-tail demon fox.</font>

76
00:05:04,020 --> 00:05:05,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then why did you do that?</font>

77
00:05:05,530 --> 00:05:08,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because I'll become a Hokage myself.</font>

78
00:05:09,290 --> 00:05:13,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I'll be the greatest Hokage
of all time!</font>

79
00:05:13,830 --> 00:05:18,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that everyone will finally
learn to accept me!</font>

80
00:05:19,670 --> 00:05:23,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By the way, Sensei,
I have a favor to ask.</font>

81
00:05:24,500 --> 00:05:25,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You want another bowl?</font>

82
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:27,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mmmm... No...</font>

83
00:05:27,210 --> 00:05:29,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can I borrow that Leaf headband
for a while?</font>

84
00:05:30,850 --> 00:05:31,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This?</font>

85
00:05:32,060 --> 00:05:33,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No no!</font>

86
00:05:33,470 --> 00:05:38,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is worn only by those who
have graduated from Ninja Academy.</font>

87
00:05:38,940 --> 00:05:40,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tomorrow, you will...</font>

88
00:05:41,230 --> 00:05:42,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're so mean!</font>

89
00:05:43,480 --> 00:05:45,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that's why you took off
your goggles...</font>

90
00:05:45,400 --> 00:05:46,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph...
One more bowl please!</font>

91
00:05:49,450 --> 00:05:51,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We are now about to begin
the graduation test.</font>

92
00:05:52,730 --> 00:05:55,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When your name is called,
proceed to the next classroom.</font>

93
00:05:56,200 --> 00:05:58,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The test is on the Clone Jutsu.</font>

94
00:05:59,330 --> 00:06:00,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh no...</font>

95
00:06:00,710 --> 00:06:04,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of all the...! That is my weakest Jutsu!</font>

96
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:11,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But still...
I will do it no matter what!</font>

97
00:06:17,180 --> 00:06:18,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Clone Jutsu!</font>

98
00:06:27,700 --> 00:06:29,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Disqualified!</font>

99
00:06:31,400 --> 00:06:32,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka-sensei.</font>

100
00:06:33,830 --> 00:06:37,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His physical coordination
and stamina are excellent.</font>

101
00:06:37,710 --> 00:06:40,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And he managed to come up
with something.</font>

102
00:06:41,480 --> 00:06:43,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't that enough
for him to pass?</font>

103
00:06:44,050 --> 00:06:49,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizuki-sensei...
All the others created three or more clones.</font>

104
00:06:50,620 --> 00:06:52,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto created just one.</font>

105
00:06:53,190 --> 00:06:57,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And it's practically useless.
I can't give him a passing mark.</font>

106
00:07:06,440 --> 00:07:07,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm a Ninja now!</font>

107
00:07:08,150 --> 00:07:09,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You did well. That's my son.</font>

108
00:07:10,490 --> 00:07:12,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Congratulations for your graduation.</font>

109
00:07:12,160 --> 00:07:13,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll cook something good tonight!</font>

110
00:07:15,240 --> 00:07:16,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look at that one.</font>

111
00:07:17,750 --> 00:07:21,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's that boy.
I hear he's the only one who failed.</font>

112
00:07:22,750 --> 00:07:23,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Serves him right.</font>

113
00:07:24,090 --> 00:07:26,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Imagine what would happen
if he became a Shinobi.</font>

114
00:07:27,060 --> 00:07:28,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't that the boy
who is actually...</font>

115
00:07:28,380 --> 00:07:30,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! We're not supposed to
talk about that.</font>

116
00:07:38,850 --> 00:07:43,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka.
We need to talk later.</font>

117
00:07:44,520 --> 00:07:45,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, sir.</font>

118
00:07:51,200 --> 00:07:55,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka-sensei isn't trying
to be mean to you.</font>

119
00:07:55,530 --> 00:07:58,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then why only me?</font>

120
00:07:58,580 --> 00:08:04,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He wants you to become strong
from the bottom of his heart.</font>

121
00:08:05,330 --> 00:08:06,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You both don't have parents.</font>

122
00:08:08,670 --> 00:08:12,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I really wanted to graduate.</font>

123
00:08:13,210 --> 00:08:16,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh... I guess I have no choice...</font>

124
00:08:19,060 --> 00:08:22,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll let you in on a big secret.</font>

125
00:08:23,890 --> 00:08:24,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Secret?</font>

126
00:08:28,650 --> 00:08:29,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka.</font>

127
00:08:30,740 --> 00:08:32,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it, Hokage-sama?</font>

128
00:08:33,450 --> 00:08:37,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know how you feel. But...</font>

129
00:08:37,280 --> 00:08:42,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto also grew up without knowing
the love of his parents... like you.</font>

130
00:08:49,380 --> 00:08:50,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let me go!</font>

131
00:08:50,340 --> 00:08:52,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My mom and dad are
still out there fighting!</font>

132
00:08:56,300 --> 00:08:58,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wake up, Iruka-sensei!</font>

133
00:09:00,520 --> 00:09:01,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter?</font>

134
00:09:02,180 --> 00:09:04,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come to Hokage-sama's immediately!</font>

135
00:09:05,100 --> 00:09:09,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I heard that Naruto-kun...
stole the Scroll of Sealing.</font>

136
00:09:10,650 --> 00:09:11,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Scroll of Sealing?!</font>

137
00:09:13,940 --> 00:09:15,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's see...</font>

138
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:20,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The first Jutsu is...
Multi-Shadow Clone Jutsu?</font>

139
00:09:20,940 --> 00:09:24,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! Already a Jutsu I'm no good at?</font>

140
00:09:24,660 --> 00:09:27,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokage-sama!
We can't forgive him!</font>

141
00:09:27,250 --> 00:09:28,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is not just a prank!</font>

142
00:09:28,380 --> 00:09:32,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Scroll is a dangerous item
that the First Hokage sealed!</font>

143
00:09:32,710 --> 00:09:34,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Depending on its use...</font>

144
00:09:34,990 --> 00:09:38,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It will be a major disaster if
it is taken out of the village!</font>

145
00:09:40,180 --> 00:09:42,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes. Bring Naruto here at once!</font>

146
00:09:43,060 --> 00:09:43,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, sir!</font>

147
00:09:54,440 --> 00:09:55,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where did you go... Naruto?</font>

148
00:10:04,500 --> 00:10:08,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will tell everyone in the village
about this and eliminate Naruto...</font>

149
00:10:08,750 --> 00:10:11,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then the Scroll of Sealing
will be mine!</font>

150
00:10:23,680 --> 00:10:26,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey you, Naruto!</font>

151
00:10:31,900 --> 00:10:33,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You found me..</font>

152
00:10:33,950 --> 00:10:36,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I've only learned one Jutsu.</font>

153
00:10:37,860 --> 00:10:39,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's been practicing the Jutsu...</font>

154
00:10:40,490 --> 00:10:42,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">until he's become
this exhausted and dirty...?</font>

155
00:10:42,320 --> 00:10:45,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen, listen!
I'm gonna show you this amazing Jutsu!</font>

156
00:10:45,860 --> 00:10:47,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're gonna let me graduate
if I can do it!</font>

157
00:10:47,990 --> 00:10:51,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't it true that I can graduate if
I can do one of the Jutsu written here?</font>

158
00:10:52,590 --> 00:10:53,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who told you that?</font>

159
00:10:54,130 --> 00:10:59,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizuki-sensei. He told me
about this scroll, and this place...</font>

160
00:11:03,180 --> 00:11:04,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizuki did?!</font>

161
00:11:09,560 --> 00:11:11,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm impressed you found this place.</font>

162
00:11:12,400 --> 00:11:14,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see now... how it is.</font>

163
00:11:18,030 --> 00:11:21,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, give me that scroll.</font>

164
00:11:21,860 --> 00:11:25,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait, wait...
What's going on here?</font>

165
00:11:27,500 --> 00:11:30,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! Never give him that scroll!</font>

166
00:11:30,710 --> 00:11:35,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It is a dangerous object that contains
forbidden Ninja Jutsu. It was sealed.</font>

167
00:11:35,500 --> 00:11:38,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizuki used you in order to
get it for himself!</font>

168
00:11:39,470 --> 00:11:40,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Wha...?</font>

169
00:11:40,840 --> 00:11:45,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, Iruka is only afraid of
you holding that scroll!</font>

170
00:11:46,180 --> 00:11:47,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

171
00:11:49,060 --> 00:11:52,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you saying, Mizuki!
Don't let him fool you, Naruto!</font>

172
00:11:54,150 --> 00:11:56,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will tell you the truth.</font>

173
00:11:56,230 --> 00:11:57,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idiot! Don't do that!</font>

174
00:11:58,200 --> 00:12:02,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After an incident 12 years ago,
a rule was created.</font>

175
00:12:03,780 --> 00:12:05,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A rule?</font>

176
00:12:05,870 --> 00:12:11,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is, Naruto, a rule everybody
but you knows.</font>

177
00:12:11,710 --> 00:12:15,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Except me?!
What is it?</font>

178
00:12:15,920 --> 00:12:17,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop it, Mizuki!</font>

179
00:12:17,750 --> 00:12:21,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The rule forbids anyone from revealing
that you are actually the Demon Fox Spirit!</font>

180
00:12:22,620 --> 00:12:23,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

181
00:12:24,260 --> 00:12:27,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are actually the Demon,
Nine-Tailed Fox Spirit,</font>

182
00:12:27,890 --> 00:12:30,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who killed Iruka's parents and
destroyed our village!</font>

183
00:12:31,270 --> 00:12:32,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop it!</font>

184
00:12:33,730 --> 00:12:36,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone has been
deceiving you ever since.</font>

185
00:12:38,070 --> 00:12:40,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Didn't you find it strange?</font>

186
00:12:40,900 --> 00:12:42,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why everyone hated you so much?</font>

187
00:12:43,490 --> 00:12:47,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! No! No! No! No!</font>

188
00:12:48,780 --> 00:12:49,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

189
00:12:50,410 --> 00:12:55,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nobody accepts you.
That's why Iruka hates you so much!</font>

190
00:12:57,290 --> 00:13:01,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka... Naruto grew up
without the love of parents.</font>

191
00:13:02,340 --> 00:13:06,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone avoids him like
the plague after what happened.</font>

192
00:13:07,140 --> 00:13:12,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why he keeps misbehaving.</font>

193
00:13:12,890 --> 00:13:18,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the only way for him to get
any attention or acknowledgment.</font>

194
00:13:18,650 --> 00:13:22,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He pretends to be tough,
but inside he is really hurting.</font>

195
00:13:23,320 --> 00:13:24,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die, Naruto!</font>

196
00:13:27,530 --> 00:13:28,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!
Get down!</font>

197
00:13:42,130 --> 00:13:44,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why...?</font>

198
00:13:46,300 --> 00:13:47,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because you and I are the same.</font>

199
00:13:49,010 --> 00:13:50,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After my parents died,</font>

200
00:13:51,140 --> 00:13:55,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">nobody paid attention to me
or gave me any support.</font>

201
00:13:57,320 --> 00:13:59,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wasn't a good student in school.</font>

202
00:13:59,060 --> 00:14:04,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was the class clown...
because I wanted people to notice me.</font>

203
00:14:05,530 --> 00:14:11,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I couldn't get noticed through excellence,
so I kept doing stupid things.</font>

204
00:14:14,910 --> 00:14:16,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was so hard.</font>

205
00:14:18,420 --> 00:14:20,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't that right, Naruto?</font>

206
00:14:21,500 --> 00:14:26,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You felt so lonely... right?
And you suffered inside, right?</font>

207
00:14:27,720 --> 00:14:29,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry, Naruto...</font>

208
00:14:30,340 --> 00:14:35,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I had been more responsible,
maybe you wouldn't have suffered so much.</font>

209
00:14:38,980 --> 00:14:40,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't make me laugh!</font>

210
00:14:40,730 --> 00:14:45,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka has always hated you,
ever since you killed his parents!</font>

211
00:14:46,030 --> 00:14:49,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's just saying all that
to get the Scroll of Sealing back!</font>

212
00:14:53,200 --> 00:14:54,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

213
00:14:55,870 --> 00:14:57,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

214
00:15:00,250 --> 00:15:03,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He is not the type of kid
who will change his mind.</font>

215
00:15:04,250 --> 00:15:07,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He will take revenge against
our village using that scroll!</font>

216
00:15:08,920 --> 00:15:12,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Didn't you see his eyes?
Those are the eyes of a Demon Fox.</font>

217
00:15:15,970 --> 00:15:21,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No...
Naruto... isn't... like that at all!</font>

218
00:15:23,940 --> 00:15:27,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All I want is to kill Naruto
and get the scroll.</font>

219
00:15:28,490 --> 00:15:29,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll take care of you later!</font>

220
00:15:30,450 --> 00:15:32,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I won't let you...</font>

221
00:15:35,910 --> 00:15:37,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, well.</font>

222
00:15:37,620 --> 00:15:39,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizuki has a big mouth!</font>

223
00:15:40,160 --> 00:15:43,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto feels worse than he's ever felt.</font>

224
00:15:43,460 --> 00:15:46,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He might unleash
the power locked up inside him.</font>

225
00:15:47,500 --> 00:15:51,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Scroll of Sealing is now with him.</font>

226
00:15:52,380 --> 00:15:56,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's a slight chance
he might actually release</font>

227
00:15:56,220 --> 00:15:59,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Nine-Tailed Fox Spirit
sealed inside him!</font>

228
00:16:00,560 --> 00:16:01,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that happens...</font>

229
00:16:04,400 --> 00:16:05,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've found him!</font>

230
00:16:07,320 --> 00:16:08,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

231
00:16:08,480 --> 00:16:10,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everything that Mizuki said
was a lie!</font>

232
00:16:10,530 --> 00:16:14,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give me that scroll, quick!
Mizuki is after the scroll!</font>

233
00:16:30,210 --> 00:16:31,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be...</font>

234
00:16:37,640 --> 00:16:40,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why is it, Naruto?</font>

235
00:16:41,890 --> 00:16:42,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How...</font>

236
00:16:42,980 --> 00:16:46,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">did you know I wasn't Iruka...?</font>

237
00:16:50,570 --> 00:16:52,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because I'm Iruka.</font>

238
00:16:54,190 --> 00:16:55,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

239
00:16:57,990 --> 00:17:01,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's in it for you to protect
the one who killed your family?</font>

240
00:17:01,660 --> 00:17:05,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not gonna let a stupid idiot
like you get that scroll!</font>

241
00:17:05,670 --> 00:17:09,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're the idiot.
Naruto is the same as me.</font>

242
00:17:11,050 --> 00:17:11,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Same?</font>

243
00:17:12,460 --> 00:17:16,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyone can do whatever
he wants once he has the scroll.</font>

244
00:17:16,340 --> 00:17:18,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is no way that that monster...</font>

245
00:17:18,350 --> 00:17:21,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that Fox Spirit, won't take advantage
of the power of that scroll!</font>

246
00:17:22,850 --> 00:17:24,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're right...</font>

247
00:17:27,560 --> 00:17:29,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess it was true all along!</font>

248
00:17:30,150 --> 00:17:36,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See, Iruka-sensei never really
cared for me at all!</font>

249
00:17:36,570 --> 00:17:38,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">... if he was the Demon Fox Spirit.</font>

250
00:17:40,340 --> 00:17:42,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Naruto is different!</font>

251
00:17:42,370 --> 00:17:47,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know that he is an exceptional student.</font>

252
00:17:48,540 --> 00:17:49,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He works very hard,</font>

253
00:17:50,090 --> 00:17:53,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and he's single-minded
and clumsy at the same time.</font>

254
00:17:53,920 --> 00:18:00,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No one accepts him, but he knows
the meaning of human suffering.</font>

255
00:18:00,760 --> 00:18:02,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He is not the Demon Fox Spirit.</font>

256
00:18:02,760 --> 00:18:05,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's Uzumaki Naruto of
the Village Hidden in the Leaves!</font>

257
00:18:10,770 --> 00:18:13,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are so gullible.
Iruka!</font>

258
00:18:14,040 --> 00:18:17,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was gonna take you down later,
but I have changed my mind.</font>

259
00:18:17,400 --> 00:18:18,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die!</font>

260
00:18:20,820 --> 00:18:22,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess this is the end for me...</font>

261
00:18:29,670 --> 00:18:30,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto?!</font>

262
00:18:33,380 --> 00:18:35,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You surprised me there, freak.</font>

263
00:18:36,470 --> 00:18:40,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you ever lay a hand on Iruka-sensei,
I'll kill you!</font>

264
00:18:41,630 --> 00:18:46,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up! I can take care of a kid
like you with a single blow!</font>

265
00:18:46,680 --> 00:18:51,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't you try then?
I'll strike you back a thousand-fold!</font>

266
00:18:51,360 --> 00:18:55,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's see you try!
Show me what you can do, Demon Fox!</font>

267
00:18:56,280 --> 00:18:57,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

268
00:19:07,160 --> 00:19:08,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! You've...</font>

269
00:19:09,660 --> 00:19:15,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those aren't just images but actual clones!
That's an advanced Ninjutsu!</font>

270
00:19:17,630 --> 00:19:18,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this...?</font>

271
00:19:18,920 --> 00:19:21,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter?
C'mon!</font>

272
00:19:21,470 --> 00:19:25,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Weren't you gonna get me
with one blow? Here!</font>

273
00:19:25,390 --> 00:19:27,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In that case...
I'll come to you.</font>

274
00:19:44,120 --> 00:19:48,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I kinda got carried away.
Iruka-sensei, are you okay?</font>

275
00:19:49,540 --> 00:19:50,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

276
00:19:52,000 --> 00:19:53,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's really something.</font>

277
00:19:54,080 --> 00:19:55,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Maybe it is true.</font>

278
00:19:55,770 --> 00:19:57,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Maybe he will surpass all
the Hokage leaders...</font>

279
00:20:00,840 --> 00:20:05,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, come over here.
I'd like to give you something.</font>

280
00:20:08,520 --> 00:20:10,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Has anyone found Naruto yet?</font>

281
00:20:10,930 --> 00:20:11,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No.</font>

282
00:20:12,140 --> 00:20:14,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn, this is going to be bad...</font>

283
00:20:15,790 --> 00:20:18,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no need to worry anymore.</font>

284
00:20:19,260 --> 00:20:20,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokage-sama!</font>

285
00:20:21,400 --> 00:20:24,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He'll be back soon.</font>

286
00:20:25,490 --> 00:20:27,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sensei, how much longer?</font>

287
00:20:27,990 --> 00:20:30,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, you may open your eyes now.</font>

288
00:20:41,760 --> 00:20:44,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Congratulations... on your graduation.</font>

289
00:20:49,970 --> 00:20:54,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In celebration, we'll have ramen tonight!</font>

290
00:21:01,490 --> 00:21:02,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka-sensei!</font>

291
00:21:03,360 --> 00:21:04,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That hurts!</font>

292
00:21:05,610 --> 00:21:06,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

293
00:21:07,240 --> 00:21:09,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was going to lecture to you...</font>

294
00:21:09,580 --> 00:21:13,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that the road gets more difficult
now that you're a Shinobi.</font>

295
00:21:13,410 --> 00:21:17,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I guess I'll just wait to tell you
that until we get to the ramen stand...</font>

296
00:21:32,900 --> 00:21:36,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Cultivate your hunger before you idealize.</font></b></font></font></font>

297
00:21:36,280 --> 00:21:39,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Motivate your anger to make them all realize.</font></b></font></font></font>

298
00:21:39,740 --> 00:21:42,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Climbing the mountain, never coming down.</font></b></font></font></font>

299
00:21:42,910 --> 00:21:46,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Break into the contents, never falling down.</font></b></font></font></font>

300
00:21:50,090 --> 00:21:53,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">My knee is still shaking, like I was twelve.</font></b></font></font></font>

301
00:21:53,340 --> 00:21:56,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Sneaking out of the classroom, by the back door.</font></b></font></font></font>

302
00:21:56,680 --> 00:22:00,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">A man railed at me twice though, but I didn't care.</font></b></font></font></font>

303
00:22:00,140 --> 00:22:03,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Waiting is wasting for people like me.</font></b></font></font></font>

304
00:22:03,810 --> 00:22:06,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Don't try to look so wise.</font></b></font></font></font>

305
00:22:06,810 --> 00:22:10,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Don't cry 'cause you're so right.</font></b></font></font></font>

306
00:22:10,270 --> 00:22:13,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Don't dry with fakes or fears,</font></b></font></font></font>

307
00:22:13,860 --> 00:22:17,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">'Cause you will hate yourself in the end.</font></b></font></font></font>

308
00:22:26,830 --> 00:22:30,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't try to look so wise.</font></b></font></font></font>

309
00:22:30,170 --> 00:22:33,550
